        <h2>The Story of <em style="font-style: italic; font-weight: 300;">Samay Parfumes</em></h2>
        <p>
          In Sanskrit and Hindi, <strong>Samay</strong> means <em>Time</em>. Our perfumery was born from a singular obsession: creating fragrances that refuse to be forgotten. While fashion changes every season, memories ignited by scent echo forever.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every bottle of Zyro is meticulously crafted in small batches in India, marrying traditional Indian distillation of rare resins and agarwood with French Grasse perfumery techniques. We do not mass produce; each flacon is macerated in dark temperature-controlled cellars for over 60 days to ensure a rich, intoxicating trail.
        </p>

        <div class="samay-about-stats">
          <div class="samay-stat-item">
            <strong>35%</strong>
            <span>Pure Extrait Oil</span>
          </div>
          <div class="samay-stat-item">
            <strong>60+</strong>
            <span>Days Maceration</span>
          </div>
          <div class="samay-stat-item">
            <strong>100%</strong>
            <span>Cruelty Free</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="samay-about-media">
        <img 
          src="{{ 'zyro-single.jpg' | asset_url }}" 
          alt="Artisanal creation of Zyro perfume"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ==========================================================================
     9. INTERACTIVE CONTACT US & FAQ (ON HOMEPAGE)
     ========================================================================== -->
<section class="samay-contact-section" id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="samay-sec-header">
      <div class="samay-sec-eyebrow">ASSISTANCE & CONCIERGE</div>
      <h2 class="samay-sec-title">We are Here <em>For You</em></h2>
      <p class="samay-sec-subtitle">
        Have a question about your order, tracking, or choosing between our single bottle and combos? Reach out directly to our concierge team.
      </p>
      <div class="samay-sec-divider"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="samay-contact-grid">
      <!-- Contact Form -->
      <div class="samay-contact-form-box">
        <h3 class="serif-font" style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">Send a Message</h3>
        <form id="samayContactForm">
          <div class="samay-form-group">
            <label class="samay-form-label">Full Name</label>
            <input type="text" class="samay-form-input" placeholder="e.g. Rahul Sharma" required>
          </div>
          <div class="samay-form-group">
            <label class="samay-form-label">Email Address</label>
            <input type="email" class="samay-form-input" placeholder="e.g. rahul@example.com" required>
          </div>
          <div class="samay-form-group">
            <label class="samay-form-label">Phone / WhatsApp</label>
            <input type="tel" class="samay-form-input" placeholder="+91 98765 43210" required>
          </div>
          <div class="samay-form-group">
            <label class="samay-form-label">Inquiry Topic</label>
            <select class="samay-form-select">
              <option value="order">Order Status & Tracking</option>
              <option value="combo">Advice on 2-in-1 or 3-in-1 Combo</option>
              <option value="gifting">Corporate / Bulk Gifting</option>
              <option value="general">General Fragrance Inquiry</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="samay-form-group">
            <label class="samay-form-label">Your Message</label>
            <textarea class="samay-form-textarea" rows="4" placeholder="How can our concierge assist you today?" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="samay-btn samay-btn--gold samay-btn--full">
            SEND MESSAGE
          </button>
          <div id="samayContactSuccess" style="display:none; margin-top:16px; color:#2e7d32; font-weight:600; text-align:center; font-size:0.9rem;">
            ✦ Thank you! Our perfumery concierge will contact you within 2 hours.
          </div>
        </form>

      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Accordion -->
      <div class="samay-faq-box">
        <h3 class="serif-font" style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>

        <div class="samay-faq-item is-open">
          <button type="button" class="samay-faq-question">
            <span>How long does Zyro last on skin and clothes?</span>
            <span class="samay-faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="samay-faq-answer">
            Zyro is formulated as a 35% Extrait de Parfum concentration (significantly higher than typical EDTs or standard EDPs). On moisturized skin, it lasts 12 to 14+ hours. On clothing and outerwear, its rich amber and agarwood base notes can linger for multiple days.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="samay-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="samay-faq-question">
            <span>What is the difference between the single and combo packs?</span>
            <span class="samay-faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="samay-faq-answer">
            The fragrance formulation in all 3 editions is identical (Zyro 50ml). The 2-in-1 Duo combo and 3-in-1 Grand Trio offer substantial volume discounts (up to ₹2,100 in savings) and include complimentary luxury presentation gift boxes.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="samay-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="samay-faq-question">
            <span>What are the shipping times and is delivery free?</span>
            <span class="samay-faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="samay-faq-answer">
            Yes, express shipping is 100% complimentary across all pin codes in India for all orders. Metro cities (Delhi NCR, Mumbai, Bangalore, Pune) typically receive delivery in 2-3 business days. All other locations take 3-5 business days with live tracking provided via SMS and WhatsApp.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="samay-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="samay-faq-question">
            <span>What is your damaged replacement guarantee?</span>
            <span class="samay-faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="samay-faq-answer">
            Every bottle is packaged inside thick shock-resistant transit cushions. In the rare event of transit damage or leakage, simply share a quick photo on WhatsApp (+91 99999 99999) within 48 hours and we will dispatch a brand-new replacement bottle immediately with zero hassle.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="samay-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="samay-faq-question">
            <span>Is Cash on Delivery (COD) supported?</span>
            <span class="samay-faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="samay-faq-answer">
            Yes! We accept Cash on Delivery (COD), UPI (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm), and all major credit/debit cards during checkout.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

